hat’s in it for you? We want you to bring your full self to work—your ideas, your energy, your ambition. You’ll have the tools and freedom to grow your skills, shape your path, and take on challenges that matter. Here, your work creates impact you can see and feel, every day. More about us The Measurement & Analytics Division is among the world’s leading manufacturers and suppliers of smart instrumentation and analyzers, working at the heart of industrial digital transformation. The Measurement & Analytics Division’s portfolio consists of analyzers measuring compositions of gases and liquids; instrumentation measuring process variables such as temperature, pressure, flow, and level; force measurement solutions measuring parameters such as flatness, thickness, and tension; and advanced digital solutions for device management, device health check and predictive maintenance. The Measurement & Analytics Division serves key industries such as oil and gas, chemical, water and wastewater, power, hydrogen, batteries, as well as the marine industry. The Division enables the optimization of industrial processes by providing and analyzing data collected from sensing and smart measurement devices. Parameters such as emission levels and production inputs are measured by providing ‘before’ and ‘after’ values, enabling efficient operations and environmental sustainability through measurement. Call to Action Join us. Be part of the team where progress happens, industries transform, and your work shapes the world. Run What Runs the World. EVP Hashtags #ABBCareers',86,72,75,79,89,64,69,'{\"stress\": 79, \"learning\": 75, \"innovation\": 72, \"internship\": 69, \"certificate\": 64, \"professional\": 86, \"communication\": 89}','ABB','仪器仪表制造,仪器仪表制造','{\"innovation\": 3, \"internship\": [\"3 年相关工作经验\", \"石化或油气行业服务背景\"], \"certificates\": [\"学士学位\"], \"communication\": 5, \"learningAbility\": 4, \"stressTolerance\": 5, \"professionalSkills\": [\"气相色谱 (Gas Chromatography)\", \"现场调试与验收 (Commissioning & SAT)\", \"故障排查 (Troubleshooting)\", \"石化/油气行业服务经验\", \"电气/机械/化工工艺工程\"]}'),(3344,3344,'实施工程师','廊坊','[\"物联网\"]',7.00,14.00,'7k-14k','需要弱电技术、自动化、安防系统、工业互联网+危化安全生产、物联网人才，不要纯软件人才。  你能经常到全国各地出差吗？你能到工业生产现场生产现场做技术支持吗？     真正的奋斗者在安然会有让人值得为之奋斗的事业，会有充实、高效的成长，会有高人一等的收入。',85,72,68,78,82,65,64,'{\"stress\": 78, \"learning\": 68, \"innovation\": 72, \"internship\": 64, \"certificate\": 65, \"professional\": 85, \"communication\": 82}','青岛安然物联网科技有限公司','物联网,物联网','{\"innovation\": 3, \"internship\": [], \"certificates\": [], \"communication\": 4, \"learningAbility\": 4, \"stressTolerance\": 5, \"professionalSkills\": [\"弱电技术\", \"自动化系统\", \"安防系统\", \"工业互联网\", \"危化安全生产\"]}'),(3345,3345,'Java','上海','[\"IT 服务\"]',15.00,30.00,'15k-30k','打造以数据+模型双轮驱动的工业软件aPaaS平台，构建工业软件产业生态资源，联合各方力量协同攻关，攻克核心软件急需解决的核心共性技术难题，助力工业软件国产化的快速发展。 采用互联网的技术和产品，协同现有的终端云和产业上云，提供云原生的根服务，为各行各业实现云化和数字化提供基础服务平台支持。部门提供KooMessage、KooMap、KooSearch等服务 岗位职责： 1、 担任aPaaS底座的开发工程师，负责系统模块的设计、代码编写及看护等工作。 2、 看护产品核心技术，并解决在项目开发过程遇到的关键问题。 岗位要求 1、 本科及以上学历，有力扣牛客刷题基础者优先 2、 具备较强的学习能力和基本沟通能力 我们能提供给您~ ①大厂市场领先且稳定的薪酬福利收入（根据面试能力评价等定级定薪）；②个人编程能力的快速学习提升（导师6个月带教）；③行业前沿的技术框架（不用担心未来如果换工作技术框架不适用）；④行业领先的产品研发项目管理流程、编码规范培训、纯粹的工程师氛围（您要相信，和优秀的人一起工作，您也必定变得更优秀）。 您需要经过什么面试流程~ ①机考；②综测；③在线面试。',88,76,72,81,74,65,68,'{\"stress\": 81, \"learning\": 72, \"innovation\": 76, \"internship\": 68, \"certificate\": 65, \"professional\": 88, \"communication\": 74}','外企德科数字技术有限公司','专业技术服务','{\"innovation\": 4, \"internship\": [], \"certificates\": [], \"communication\": 4, \"learningAbility\": 5, \"stressTolerance\": 3, \"professionalSkills\": [\"Java\", \"云原生\", \"aPaaS 平台开发\", \"系统模块设计\", \"算法基础\"]}'),(3346,3346,'Java','武汉','[\"IT 服务\"]',15.00,30.00,'15k-30k','欢迎有能力的你，想学习技术的你，加入我们！  【注】考公、考研等未就业者，转行等无工作经验者，均可参加面试，且面试通过后入职。  通用要求：  1.熟悉Java/C/C++/Python等其中一种语言，具备良好的算法和编程能力。  2.熟悉Spring、Spring Boot 、Spring Cloud等各种开源框架。  3.熟悉Mysql、Oracle等数据库。  4.熟悉Devops，熟悉Docker，熟悉Kubernetes等。  面试方向：  软件开发、测试开发、数据、运维、算法、AI相关、鸿蒙开发、云计算开发、分布式开发等等等等等等等（多种方向选择，欢迎小窗沟通）  岗位福利：  1.入